       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             SPMNEWWO.
       AUTHOR.                 W. ROXBURY.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *REMARKS. **** PREVENTIVE MAINTENANCE WORKORDER UPDATE PROGRAM:
      *                  A - FOR CREATION OF SUFFIXED WORKORDERS
      *                  B - FOR CREATION OF THE PM-QUEUE RECORDS
      *
      *                USER-CODE INDICATORS:
      *                 'MAN-RLSE' - MANUAL RELEASE
      *                 'CAL-RLSE' - CALENDAR RELEASE
      *                 'PRE-RLSE' - PLANNER PRE-RELEASE
      *                 'AUTO-REL' - AUTOMATIC SCHEDULER RELEASE
      *                      ****.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      * CHANGES:
      * 02/25/93  JEFF BUNGO, REQ #6306.
      *      CREATE ALL PRE-RELEASED WORKORDERS IN 'PR' STATUS.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 06/01/93  JEFF BUNGO, REQ #6033.
      *      CHANGE TO WORK WITH MASTER SCHEDULE RECORDS.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 04/22/98  JIM COFFMAN
      *      ADDED A PM-QUEUE-DATA-SAVE WORKING STORAGE AREA AND
      *      A SAVE OF THE READ PM-QUEUE-DATA RECORD IN PARAGRAPH
      *      FIND-PRE-REL-NEXT WHEN A TRACE OF A TYLER BLOWUP OF
      *      THE AUTOMATIC SCHEDULER (TPMSCHED) REVEALED THAT WE
      *      WERE TRYING TO CHANGE THE NEXT SEQUENTIALLY READ RECORD
      *      FROM PM-QUEUE-DATA INSTEAD OF THE CORRECT SUFFIX OF THE
      *      MASTER THAT WE STARTED WITH.
      *
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT WO-PLANNED
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT PMOQ
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM3902
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  WO-PLANNED
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PWO-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1101.

       FD  PMOQ
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PMOQ-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM3902.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  COND-CODE           PIC X.
       77  ERROR-DISP          PIC -9999.
       77  ERROR-SW            PIC X.
       77  ERROR-SWITCH        PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE ZEROS.
       77  FIND-SW             PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 0.
       77  RIME-CALC           PIC 99           VALUE ZEROS.
       77  LEVEL-CODE          PIC 99           VALUE ZEROS.
       77  TERM-DEV            PIC 9(4)         VALUE ZEROS.
       77  SEQ-NO              PIC 9999         VALUE ZEROS.
       77  SEQ-NO-TEMP         PIC 999          VALUE ZEROS.
       77  MSG-SW              PIC X.
       77  ACD-SW              PIC X.
       77  BASE                PIC X(24) VALUE "  MMISA;".

       01  FILE-STAT.
           05 FILE-STAT-1      PIC X   VALUE "0".
           05 FILE-STAT-2      PIC X   VALUE "0".

       01  PM-QUEUE-DATA-SAVE  PIC X(92).

       01  WO-NUM-MASTER.
           05  MASTER-WO       PIC X(07).
           05  MASTER-SUFFIX   PIC XXX.

       01  WO-LINK-DATA.
           05  LINK-WO         PIC X(10).
           05  LINK-EQUIP      PIC X(06).
           05  LINK-DESC       PIC X(30).

       01  ERROR-MESSAGE.
           05  ERROR-TEXT      PIC X(70).
           05  ERROR-FILL      PIC X(06) VALUE "000000".
           05  ERROR-CODE      REDEFINES ERROR-FILL PIC 9(06).

       01  PRINT-LINE.
           05  PL-1            PIC X(20).
           05  PL-2            PIC X(10).
           05  PL-3.
               10  PL-3-1      PIC X(20).
               10  PL-3-2      PIC X(30).

       01  PRTY.
           05  P-1             PIC X.
           05  P-2             PIC X.

       01  DATE-BUFF.
           05 Y-BUFF           PIC XX.
           05 M-BUFF           PIC XX.
           05 D-BUFF           PIC XX.

       01  TODAYS-DATE.
           05  TODAY-CT        PIC 9(02).
           05  TODAY-YYMMDD.
               10  TODAY-YY    PIC 9(02).
               10  TODAY-MM    PIC 9(02).
               10  TODAY-DD    PIC 9(02).

       01  TIME-BUFF.
           05 TIME-HHMM        PIC XXXX.
           05 TIME-SECS        PIC XX.
           05 TIME-TNTHS       PIC XX.

       01  LEVEL-MSG.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(06) VALUE "LEVEL ".
           05  LEVEL           PIC Z9.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(12) VALUE " PM RELEASE ".
           05  MANREL          PIC X(10) VALUE "          ".

       01  DESC-MSG.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(16) VALUE "  DESCRIPTION:  ".
           05  DESCN           PIC X(64).

       01  DESC-REDEFINE.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(36) VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-DESC       PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.

       01  CRAFT-LABOR-X.
           05 CRAFT-LABOR-RATE PIC 999999V99 VALUE ZEROS.

       01  SAVE-SUFFIX.
           05 SAVE-SUFFIX-NUM  PIC 9(3) VALUE ZEROS.
           05 FILLER           PIC X.

       01  OUT-MESSAGE.
           05  OM1             PIC X(44).
           05  OM2             PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER          PIC X(10) VALUE "  LEVEL:  ".
           05  OM3             PIC 9(02).
           05  FILLER          PIC X(14) VALUE SPACES.

       01  DB-ERROR.
           05  DB-FUNC         PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05  DB-FILE         PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(20) VALUE "ERROR - FILE-STAT = ".
           05  CON-WORD        PIC XX.

           COPY TBLOWUP        IN COPYLIB.

           COPY DBSTAT         IN COPYLIB.

           COPY VCOMLINK       IN COPYLIB.

       01  WO-PLANNED-DATA.
           COPY DWOPLAN        IN COPYLIB.

       01  WO-TRACK-DATA.
           COPY DWOTRACK       IN COPYLIB.

       01  PM-QUEUE-DATA.
           COPY DPMOPENQ       IN COPYLIB.

       01  PM-AUDIT-DATA.
           COPY DPMAUDIT       IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  DBPARAMETERS.
           COPY DBPARMS        IN COPYLIB.

       01  PM-SCHED-DATA.
           COPY DPMSCHED       IN COPYLIB.

       01  CRAFT-TABLE.
           05 C-R-ENTRY OCCURS 200 TIMES INDEXED BY CRAFT-INDEX.
              10 CRAFT         PIC X(2).
              10 RATE          PIC 999999V99.

       01  USER-CODE           PIC X(08).

       01  PRINT-DATA.
           05  PRINT-1         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-2         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-3         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-4         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-5         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-6         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-7         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-8         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-9         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-0         PIC X(80).
           05  PRINT-ERR       PIC X(02).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING DBPARAMETERS
                               PM-SCHED-DATA
                               CRAFT-TABLE
                               USER-CODE
                               PRINT-DATA.
       OPEN-FILES.
           OPEN I-O            WO-PLANNED.
           OPEN INPUT          PMOQ.

       START-PROGRAM.
           ACCEPT DATE-BUFF    FROM DATE.
           MOVE DATE-BUFF      TO TODAY-YYMMDD.

           IF TODAY-YY > 60
               MOVE 19         TO TODAY-CT
           ELSE
               MOVE 20         TO TODAY-CT.

           ACCEPT TIME-BUFF    FROM TIME.

           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-TRACK-DATA PRINT-DATA PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE "SPMNEWWO"     TO PROGRAM-NAME.
           MOVE TODAYS-DATE    TO DATE-STAMP-CN.
           MOVE TIME-HHMM      TO TIME-STAMP.
           MOVE SPACES         TO USER-ID CLOCK-CARD.
           MOVE SPACES         TO TRANS-STATUS.
           MOVE "AA"           TO WO-TYPE-STATUS.
           MOVE USER-CODE      TO USER-NAME.
           MOVE "AUTO"         TO USER-TERM.

       CHECK-FOR-PRE-RELEASED-WO.
           IF USER-CODE = "AUTO-REL" OR "CAL-RLSE"
               IF SCH-PREREL-DATE NOT = SPACES
                   PERFORM FIND-PRE-REL-RECORD THRU FPRR-EXIT
                   MOVE PMQ-WO-NUM TO SCH-WO-NUM
                   PERFORM UPDATE-PR-WO-RECORD THRU UPWR-EXIT
                   GO TO END-OF-JOB.

       UPDATE-MASTER-PM.
           MOVE SCH-WO-NUM     TO WO-NUM-MASTER.
           MOVE "000"          TO MASTER-SUFFIX.
           MOVE WO-NUM-MASTER  TO WONUM OF WO-PLANNED.

           READ WO-PLANNED     INTO WO-PLANNED-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ    " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE "WO-PLANNED" TO DB-FILE
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "  PROGRAM ERROR:  SPMNEWWO  -  "
                               TO PRINT-LINE
               MOVE "XX"       TO PRINT-ERR
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO PRINT-LINE
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           IF WO-STATUS-P NOT = "OO"
               MOVE "MASTER WORK ORDER:  " TO PL-1
               MOVE WO-NUM-MASTER          TO PL-2
               MOVE " NOT 'OO' STATUS."    TO PL-3
               MOVE "XX"       TO PRINT-ERR
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           MOVE LAST-SUFFIX-INIT TO SAVE-SUFFIX.
           IF SAVE-SUFFIX-NUM IS NUMERIC
               IF SAVE-SUFFIX-NUM > 998
                   MOVE "MASTER WORK ORDER:  " TO PL-1
                   MOVE WO-NUM-MASTER          TO PL-2
                   MOVE " HAS 999 SUFFIXES"    TO PL-3
                   MOVE "XX"   TO PRINT-ERR
                   PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
                   GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           IF SAVE-SUFFIX-NUM IS NUMERIC
               ADD  1          TO SAVE-SUFFIX-NUM
           ELSE
               MOVE 1          TO SAVE-SUFFIX-NUM.

           MOVE SAVE-SUFFIX    TO LAST-SUFFIX-INIT.
           MOVE SAVE-SUFFIX-NUM TO SCH-WO-SUFF.

           REWRITE PWO-REC     FROM WO-PLANNED-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "REWRITE " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE "WO-PLANNED" TO DB-FILE
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "  PROGRAM ERROR:  SPMNEWWO  -  "
                               TO PRINT-LINE
               MOVE "XX"       TO PRINT-ERR
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO PRINT-LINE
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           MOVE "MASTER WORK ORDER:  " TO PL-1.
           MOVE WO-NUM-MASTER          TO PL-2.
           MOVE " HAS BEEN UPDATED."   TO PL-3.
           PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT.

           MOVE SAVE-SUFFIX    TO    WO-NUM-SUFF-P.
           MOVE TODAYS-DATE    TO    DATE-RECD-P-CN.
           MOVE TIME-STAMP     TO    TIME-RECD-P.
           MOVE SCH-PRIORITY   TO    PRTY.
           MOVE P-2            TO    PRIORITY-P.
           MOVE SPACES         TO    TIME-SCHD.

      **************************************************************
           IF USER-CODE = "PRE-RLSE"
      **************************************************************
               MOVE SPACES     TO   DATE-SCHD-CN TIME-SCHD TIME-REQD
               MOVE SCH-PREREL-DATE TO DATE-REQD-CN
               MOVE "PR"       TO   WO-STATUS-P WO-STATUS-TRACK
               MOVE "2"        TO MSG-SW
           ELSE
      **************************************************************
      **>> IF USER-CODE = "AUTO-REL", "MAN-RLSE", OR "CAL-RLSE"
      **************************************************************
               MOVE TODAYS-DATE TO  DATE-SCHD-CN DATE-REQD-CN
               MOVE TIME-STAMP TO   TIME-SCHD TIME-REQD
               MOVE "SD"       TO   WO-STATUS-P WO-STATUS-TRACK
               MOVE "1"        TO MSG-SW.

           PERFORM CALCULATE-RIME-FACTOR.

           MOVE RIME-CALC      TO    RIME-P.
           MOVE SPACES         TO    MANREL.
           IF USER-CODE = "MAN-RLSE"
               MOVE "- MANUAL" TO    MANREL.
           IF SCH-REC-TYP = "CL"
               MOVE "- CALENDAR" TO  MANREL.
           MOVE SPACES           TO  SPECL-INSTR-2.
           MOVE DESCRIPTION-1-P  TO  SPECL-INSTR-2.
           MOVE SCH-LEVEL      TO    LEVEL.
           MOVE LEVEL-MSG      TO    DESCRIPTION-1-P.
           MOVE 0              TO    ERROR-SWITCH.
           MOVE "0"            TO    COND-CODE.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES     TO    STATUS-AREA.

           CALL "TADDWOII"     USING DBPARAMETERS
                               STATUS-AREA
                               WO-PLANNED-DATA
                               COND-CODE
                               ERROR-SWITCH.

           IF ERROR-SWITCH NOT = 0
               MOVE ERROR-SWITCH TO ERROR-DISP
               MOVE "ERROR IN PROGRAM TADDWOII"
                               TO PRINT-LINE
               MOVE "XX"       TO PRINT-ERR
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               MOVE "SUFFIXED WORKORDER: " TO PL-1
               MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED         TO PL-2
               MOVE " CAN NOT BE ADDED TO DATA BASE."
                                           TO PL-3
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               MOVE "       ERROR-CODE = " TO PL-1
               MOVE ERROR-DISP             TO PL-2
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED TO LINK-WO.
           MOVE EQUIP-NUM-P    TO LINK-EQUIP.
           MOVE DESCRIPTION-1-P TO LINK-DESC.
           PERFORM WRITE-MSG-PROG.

           MOVE "SUFFIXED WORKORDER: " TO PL-1.
           MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED         TO PL-2.
           MOVE " HAS BEEN CREATED."   TO PL-3-1.
           MOVE LEVEL-MSG              TO PL-3-2.
           PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO DESCN.
           MOVE SPECL-INSTR-2          TO DESCN.
           MOVE DESC-MSG               TO PRINT-LINE.
           PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT.

       WRITE-PM-QUEUE-DATA.
           MOVE SPACES         TO  PM-QUEUE-DATA ERROR-MESSAGE.
           MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED TO  PMQ-WO-NUM.
           MOVE DESCRIPTION-1-P TO  PMQ-DESCRIPTION.
           MOVE EQUIP-NUM-P    TO  PMQ-EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE ZONE-PRIORITY-P TO  PMQ-ZONE-PRI.
           MOVE SCH-REC-TYPE   TO  PMQ-REC-TYPE.
           MOVE SCH-RELEASE-DATE TO  PMQ-DATE.
           IF SCH-REC-TYP NOT = "CL"
               MOVE SCH-CRITICAL     TO  PMQ-CRITICAL
               MOVE SCH-CYCLE        TO  PMQ-CYCLE
               MOVE SCH-LOOK-AHEAD   TO  PMQ-LOOK-AHEAD
               MOVE SCH-PRE-REL      TO  PMQ-PRE-REL.
           IF USER-CODE = "MAN-RLSE"
               MOVE TODAYS-DATE TO  PMQ-DATE
               MOVE "MR"       TO  PMQ-REC-TYPE.
           IF USER-CODE = "PRE-RLSE"
               MOVE SCH-PREREL-DATE TO PMQ-DATE
               MOVE SCH-PR-ID  TO  PMQ-PR-ID.
           MOVE RIME-CALC      TO  PM-QUEUE-FACTOR.
           MOVE "A"            TO  ACD-SW.

           CALL "TPMQUEUE"     USING DBPARAMETERS
                               PM-QUEUE-DATA
                               ACD-SW
                               ERROR-MESSAGE.

           IF ERROR-MESSAGE NOT = SPACES
               MOVE "  PROGRAM ERROR:  SPMNEWWO  - "
                               TO PRINT-LINE
               MOVE "XX"       TO PRINT-ERR
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               MOVE ERROR-MESSAGE TO PRINT-LINE
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

       WRITE-CREATE-AUDIT.
           MOVE SPACES         TO PM-AUDIT-DATA  ERROR-MESSAGE.
           MOVE TODAYS-DATE    TO AUDIT-DATE  AUDIT-YRMO.
           MOVE TIME-HHMM      TO AUDIT-TIME.
           MOVE "CR"           TO AUDIT-TRANS.
           MOVE EQUIP-NUM-P    TO AUDIT-EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED TO AUDIT-WO-NUM.
           MOVE WO-STATUS-P    TO AUDIT-WO-STATUS.
           MOVE SCH-LEVEL      TO AUDIT-PM-LEVEL.
           MOVE "WORKORDER CREATED " TO AUDIT-DESC.
           IF USER-CODE = "MAN-RLSE"
               MOVE "WORKORDER CREATED, MANUAL RLSE" TO AUDIT-DESC.
           IF WO-STATUS-P = "PR"
               MOVE "PRE-RELEASE WORKORDER CREATED " TO AUDIT-DESC.
           PERFORM WRITE-AUDIT-RECORD.

       WRITE-WO-TRACKING-DATA.
           MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED TO WO-NUM-TRACK.
           CALL "TWOTRACK"     USING WO-TRACK-DATA.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               WO-PLANNED.
           GOBACK.

       FIND-PRE-REL-RECORD.
           MOVE SCH-EQUIP-NUM  TO EQPNUM OF PMOQ.
           START PMOQ KEY = EQPNUM OF PMOQ
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               GO TO FPRR-EXIT.

       FIND-PRE-REL-NEXT.
           READ PMOQ NEXT      INTO PM-QUEUE-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
               GO TO FPRR-EXIT
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ NEXT PMOQ ERROR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE SCH-EQUIP-NUM TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.

           IF PMQ-EQUIP-NUM NOT = SCH-EQUIP-NUM
               MOVE PM-QUEUE-DATA-SAVE TO PM-QUEUE-DATA
               GO TO FPRR-EXIT.

           MOVE PM-QUEUE-DATA TO PM-QUEUE-DATA-SAVE.

           IF SCH-RELEASE-DATE = PMQ-DATE AND
              SCH-PR-ID = PMQ-PR-ID
               PERFORM UPDATE-QUEUE-RECORD
               PERFORM WRITE-PREREL-AUDIT
               GO TO FPRR-EXIT.

           GO TO FIND-PRE-REL-NEXT.

       FPRR-EXIT.              EXIT.

       UPDATE-PR-WO-RECORD.
           MOVE PMQ-WO-NUM     TO WONUM OF WO-PLANNED.
           READ WO-PLANNED     INTO WO-PLANNED-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ    " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE "WO-PLANNED" TO DB-FILE
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "  PROGRAM ERROR:  SPMNEWWO  -  "
                               TO PRINT-LINE
               MOVE "XX"       TO PRINT-ERR
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO PRINT-LINE
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           MOVE TODAYS-DATE    TO   DATE-SCHD-CN.
           MOVE TIME-STAMP     TO   TIME-SCHD.
           MOVE "SD"           TO   WO-STATUS-P.

           REWRITE PWO-REC     FROM WO-PLANNED-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "REWRITE " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE "WO-PLANNED" TO DB-FILE
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "  PROGRAM ERROR:  SPMNEWWO  -  "
                               TO PRINT-LINE
               MOVE "XX"       TO PRINT-ERR
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO PRINT-LINE
               PERFORM DISPLAY-PRINT
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           MOVE "1"            TO MSG-SW.
           MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED TO LINK-WO.
           MOVE EQUIP-NUM-P    TO LINK-EQUIP.
           MOVE DESCRIPTION-1-P TO LINK-DESC.
           PERFORM WRITE-MSG-PROG.

       UPWR-EXIT.              EXIT.

       CALCULATE-RIME-FACTOR.
           MOVE 5              TO RIME-CALC.
           IF RIME-P NUMERIC
             IF RIME-P > 0 AND < 10
               MOVE RIME-P     TO RIME-CALC.

           IF SCH-PRIORITY = 1 COMPUTE RIME-CALC = RIME-CALC * 5.
           IF SCH-PRIORITY = 2 COMPUTE RIME-CALC = RIME-CALC * 4.
           IF SCH-PRIORITY = 3 COMPUTE RIME-CALC = RIME-CALC * 3.
           IF SCH-PRIORITY = 4 COMPUTE RIME-CALC = RIME-CALC * 2.
           IF SCH-PRIORITY = 5 COMPUTE RIME-CALC = RIME-CALC * 1.

       UPDATE-QUEUE-RECORD.
           MOVE SPACES         TO ERROR-MESSAGE.
           MOVE SCH-REC-TYPE   TO PMQ-REC-TYPE.
           MOVE TODAYS-DATE    TO PMQ-DATE.
           MOVE "C"            TO ACD-SW.
           CALL "TPMQUEUE"     USING DBPARAMETERS
                               PM-QUEUE-DATA
                               ACD-SW
                               ERROR-MESSAGE.
           IF ERROR-MESSAGE NOT = SPACES
               MOVE ERROR-MESSAGE TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.

       WRITE-PREREL-AUDIT.
           MOVE SPACES         TO PM-AUDIT-DATA ERROR-MESSAGE.
           MOVE TODAYS-DATE    TO AUDIT-DATE AUDIT-YRMO.
           MOVE TIME-HHMM      TO AUDIT-TIME.
           MOVE "QR"           TO AUDIT-TRANS.
           MOVE SCH-EQUIP-NUM  TO AUDIT-EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE PMQ-WO-NUM     TO AUDIT-WO-NUM.
           MOVE "SD"           TO AUDIT-WO-STATUS.
           MOVE SCH-LEVEL      TO AUDIT-PM-LEVEL.
           MOVE "PR RECORD ACTIVATED IN QUEUE" TO AUDIT-DESC.
           PERFORM WRITE-AUDIT-RECORD.

       WRITE-AUDIT-RECORD.
           CALL "SPMAUDIT"     USING PM-AUDIT-DATA
                               DBPARAMETERS
                               ERROR-MESSAGE.
           IF ERROR-MESSAGE NOT = SPACES
               MOVE ERROR-MESSAGE TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.

       WRITE-MSG-PROG.
           CALL "SPMWRTMS"     USING MSG-SW
                               WO-LINK-DATA
                               ERROR-MESSAGE.
           IF ERROR-MESSAGE NOT = SPACES
               MOVE ERROR-MESSAGE TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.

       DISPLAY-PRINT.
           IF PRINT-1 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-1 ELSE
           IF PRINT-2 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-2 ELSE
           IF PRINT-3 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-3 ELSE
           IF PRINT-4 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-4 ELSE
           IF PRINT-5 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-5 ELSE
           IF PRINT-6 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-6 ELSE
           IF PRINT-7 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-7 ELSE
           IF PRINT-8 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-8 ELSE
           IF PRINT-9 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-9 ELSE
           IF PRINT-0 = SPACES MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-0.

       999-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "SPMNEWWO"     TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP"      USING BASE BU-PGM-NAME STATUS-AREA
                               VIEW-COMAREA FILE-STAT
                               BU-DISPLAY-MSG BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

